at dinagul ya i jesus king masanting a pamikakatawan ampon king kabiasnan at katanggaptanggap ya king dios at karing tau
ing kukupas dang dangalan deting palalung manimuna lumbug anti ding mumunang bunga na ning tanaman a higera neng panaun da agadagad lang mayagtal at mapangan kabud melulut la
